  "title": "Broadstone Net Lease Announces Second Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "VICTOR, N.Y. – Broadstone Net Lease, Inc. (NYSE: BNL) (“BNL”, the “Company”, “we”, “our”, or “us”), today announced its operating results for the quarter ended June 30, 2026. MANAGEMENT COMMENTARY “Our second quarter results underscore the earnings power of our portfolio and the continued strength of our investment activity,” said John Moragne, BNL’s Chief Executive Officer. […]",
